---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: contract not paused
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale hasEnded == true
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_saft: sale active (no end time constraint)
    q_verify_saft --> q_revert_sig: SAFT signature invalid
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_verify_saft --> q_decode_saft: signature valid
    q_decode_saft --> q_check_cached: decode investAmount and tokenAllocationRate from SAFT
    q_check_cached --> q_cache_new: first investment (no cached values)
    q_check_cached --> q_validate_cached: subsequent investment
    q_cache_new --> q_check_amount: cache investAmount and tokenAllocationRate
    q_validate_cached --> q_revert_mismatch: cached values != SAFT values
    q_revert_mismatch --> [*]: revert SAFTMismatch
    q_validate_cached --> q_check_amount: cached values match
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_exceed: total would exceed SAFT investAmount limit
    q_revert_exceed --> [*]: revert ExceedsSAFTLimit
    q_check_amount --> q_transfer: within SAFT limit
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_update --> q_set_refund_start: position.investedCapital += amount
    q_set_refund_start --> [*]: position.lastInvestTimestamp = block.timestamp, emit Invested

    note right of q_verify_saft
        INV-001: SAFT signature authorizes investment with specific terms
        INV-002: investAmount in SAFT sets maximum cumulative investment
    end note

    note right of q_check_cached
        INV-003: cached SAFT terms immutable after first investment
        INV-004: prevents SAFT term changes mid-investment
    end note

    note right of q_set_refund_start
        INV-005: lastInvestTimestamp drives per-investor refund window
        INV-006: refund window = lastInvestTimestamp + refundPeriodSeconds
    end note
